---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import headshot from '../assets/henard-gertzen.jpg';
import { pages, site } from '../site';

const meta = pages['/about/'];
const article = 'https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/lazy-optimizer-why-we-need-stop-calling-ai-henard-gertzen-dnpef/';
---

<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description} image="/og/about.png">
  <header class="page-head narrow about-head">
    <Image
      class="about-photo"
      src={headshot}
      alt="Henard Gertzen, smiling, in a white shirt and blue tie"
      width={176}
      height={176}
      densities={[1, 2]}
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">About</p>
      <h1>Hi, I’m Henard</h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="narrow about-body">
    <p class="lede">
      I’m a full-stack developer in Secunda, South Africa. I help teams get coding agents to write code that fits their
      codebase, not just code that compiles.
    </p>
    <p>
      I wrote my first software in high school, as one of a handful of students in the first year group at my school
      to take IT, and built my first WordPress websites in holiday jobs. After school I worked as a hardware technician,
      keeping clients’ systems up to date.
    </p>
    <p>
      In 2021 I started a BSc in IT at North-West University in Potchefstroom. Alongside my studies I did freelance
      graphic and web design, and helped other students set up their computers, learn their software and get through
      their projects. In my final year I led our team on <a href="/projects/#share2teach">Share2Teach</a> as team lead,
      Scrum Master and head designer.
    </p>
    <p>
      After graduating I spent a few months as an intermediate full-stack developer at EziDev, then moved back to
      Secunda. Today I work remotely as a full-stack developer on .NET and Angular software, specialising in AI
      harnesses: the setup that makes coding agents work to a team’s standards.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside work I build <a href="/projects/#games-title">games with coding agents</a>, a point-of-sale system, and
      software for philosophy and theology. I think a lot about what AI actually is and the role agents play in our
      lives, and I’ve written about <a href={article}>why I’d rather call it a lazy optimizer than intelligent</a>.
    </p>
    <p>I speak English and Afrikaans, and some Dutch.</p>
    <p>
      The best way to reach me is <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or see
      <a href="/work-with-me/">how we could work together</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
